  "content": "<a href=\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/cracked/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6145a18784d4f7a89d61cf2e46186d117f8c8441a8e7688b2cb125865c4947ed/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_h100%3Bquality_100%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2025-04%2F0d419b70-1198-11f0-9dbd-ea4fcd19b225\" alt=\"Cracked\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"234\" height=\"100\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/db6a506db1614f49f3f392995a00f51ae88647203de95c1c75496a58aa19fa76/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_h100%3Bquality_100%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2025-04%2F266a7ea0-1198-11f0-aeff-c0a6c30fc473\" alt=\"Cracked\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"234\" height=\"100\" /></p></a><p>Jay Wells L'Ecuyer</p><p><time datetime=\"2026-10-28T12:00:00.000Z\">Wed, October 28, 2026 at 12:00 PM UTC</time></p><p>1 min read</p><p>Well, this was a freaky little stroll through the haunted house-related fact section <a href=\"https://trivia.cracked.com/image-pictofact-11695-30-random-facts-thatll-juice-your-brain-like-a-fat-lemon\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">of our archives.</a> The halls of the archives down in the basement are scary enough as it is, so putting facts and tales about paranormal hotbeds down there must've been a cheeky prank or something. Maybe a salty fact finder did this on his last day as one big dig <a href=\"https://www.cracked.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">at the company.</a></p><p>Anywho, now that we've made it back to our desks safely, <a href=\"https://trivia.cracked.com/image-pictofact-9096-36-creepy-photos-that-even-complete-skeptics-cant-explain\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">we'll shake off this eerie feeling</a> and display these for you. Hopefully you're in a well-lit and/or well-populated place right now, because reading these alone in a dank basement was wildly unpleasant.</p><h2>25. The Witch's Hat</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/00f2f3578db67298e5e107757ebed8d3fa35ae58c4dcb6a795db4f2db01943e6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F1e5b68e3460162a065eeb3b5670e2c4d.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. THE WITCH'S HAT READING, PENNSYLVANIA Justin L. tells US about the observation pavilion, which is the only remains of an old hotel, where there are &quot;lots of local legends about a creepy witch whose ghost appears if you go there at night.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>24. May-Stringer Home</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7d1ed7adf20bc02e662974a039526634506313e134cab33019fc7b253c7f1989/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F6cf27aac7ce79eaafa6b85fd4c50c650.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. MAY-STRINGER HOME BROOKSVILLE, FLORIDA Mona M. tells US of the historic house turned museum, where workers have supposedly heard a crying child, seen glowing orbs, and felt cold spots. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>23. Hoia-Baciu</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7d69d7260da95e77b3f60d22d2eb5df5a15e8ac5b5673612e0dc5704f1ce5c56/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w549_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Ff3980b7845fce12c1b840afb9fa1b180.jpg\" alt=\"Cluj-Napoca, Romania THE BERMUDA TRIANGLE FOREST The twisted trees of the Hoia-Baciu forest makes it a unique but eerie site. It's also believed to be the most haunted forest in the world. There are tales of people disappearing, claims of alien abductions, and some believe there are ghosts wandering around. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"549\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>22. The Haunted Island</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9a77dd592f0b969dcbb262b23a64fdea6dbab13a2fdcec0551e84e439499e241/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F6699adcacfb43ec4b127d237873a400c.jpg\" alt=\"Venice, Italy THE HAUNTED ISLAND Poveglia Island is technically off limits to visitors, and the site was once a home to those quarantined and dying from the bubonic plague. Some believe that the soil is made up of 50% human remains. In 1922, a mental hospital was opened there, and horrible tales of a doctor brutally torturing his patients before jumping out of a bell tower are all part of its legend today. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>21. The Bell Witch Cave</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/35ff661b7824cd294025cd9b01ee06404187c033c805837b74771983f319c04b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fd11105c4650652dcd79f8b8fee7ada53.jpg\" alt=\"Adams, Tennessee THE BELL WITCH CAVE Most caves can be pretty scary, but the legend of a dark witch who tormented the Bell family in the 19th century puts this one right up there. The witch was believed to have hidden away in the cave, making people think she left the area when she never really did. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>20. The Island of the Dolls</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cc6608ce1726b8db6390d0cd7889f545c5673140d37b5d29b986a0a6f70af933/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h740%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F2aeba6e8eb0b315aaadd446c05139af0.jpg\" alt=\"THE ISLAND OF THE DOLLS WANTS YOU TO STAY AND PLAY. The legend goes that a small girl drowned in the canals near the island, and Don Julian Santana Barrera found her doll floating in the water. Не collected thousands of discarded dolls as companions for her. In 2001, Julian drowned in the same canal as the girl. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"740\" /></p></figure><h2>19. Bran Castle</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4e045045a0eeb305bb4daf17ced9bb50900c9ad365a64b15147f95abf963b7d2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w800_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Ff365c776306b1e18f63a76ba1cd4ff0e.jpg\" alt=\"Bran Castle in Transylvania, Romania. This medieval region has a ton of gothic sites, but Bran Castle, the home of Vlad III Dracul (the inspiration for Bram Stoker's Dracula) is the crown jewel. Built in 1377, it had 720,000 visitors in 2022 alone. CRACKED\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>18. U.S. Haunted Houses</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1ef4d60817f9ee00f236d27bdad66f28e0dc30633e6f86b7d5638b16e2196f2c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h822%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F81d21c8497cb2ad8eddf1b7c21054e2c.jpg\" alt=\"There are more haunted houses in the U.S. than Targets. TARGET CRACKED.COM The Haunted House Association estimates that there are more than 2,700 haunted houses in operation in the United States, compared to 1,956 Targets.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"822\" /></p></figure><h2>17. The Conjuring</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f1f8f93c220fdb17bd0ad7777d61f0933fa1a6e5f56f98fd34449293b6672911/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h600%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F9f3cb9c6e6d354bde181b79c61822c58.jpg\" alt=\"GRAGKED.COM THE CONJURING is based on a real &quot;haunted house&quot; in Rhode Island... And its current owner Norma Sutcliffe is now constantly haunted by fans who invade her home searching for ghosts.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"600\" /></p></figure><h2>16. The Lindley St. Poltergeist</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/71e819677cbe1a8e4aa9dcea693d5fdbe438a583aa6c78f011accb9badaa7fbc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fa7c3254960f16512f0b0f04872e264f5.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. LOCATION: Bridgeport, Connecticut Jesse L. lives near &quot;The World's Most Haunted House.&quot; THE WORLD'S MOST HAUNTED HOUSE THE TRUE STURY or THE BRIDGEPORT POLLERGEIST ON LINDMA STORED It's the Lindley Street Poltergeist, where even the cops report witnessing some bizarre, unexplainable shenanigans. &quot;Flying refrigerators, talking cats cursing out priests, it was wild,&quot; says Jesse. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>15. The Haunting in Connecticut</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/123d8d736e8156af308b4b7d99a1393bf81fbdb044e6dd916057aca62b260353/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F10a43895ce9efdb5e592dec2f68274f3.jpg\" alt=\"The Snedeker house THE HAUNTING IN CONNECTICUT GRACKED.COM The movie was mainly filmed in Canada, but the supposedly haunted house it was based on started getting lots of unwelcome visitors - some of them &quot;scaring our kids, telling them the house is haunted.&quot;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>14. Central State Hospital</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6052f9588b5d5533d20bb4f9f3aeb05b4e7048ccbb7711c3596fde897a20f80e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Ffe671f46bde629c85a98c36e964c55f3.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. CENTRAL STATE HOSPITAL INDIANAPOLIS, INDIANA Amelia В. tells US of the now-closed psychiatric hospital that used to house 2500 patients, saying, &quot;The place supposedly closed because of abuse of the patients. High schoolers will hang out in the abandoned buildings and see all kinds of creepy things, but I won't go anywhere near there.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>13. The City of the Dead</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e8bd85ed4abb7b32319620b04ecfd95e3e84f98f4dd7046b4547abc6ca030a83/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F94a8da414fcd03247d4db9b1c3032390.jpg\" alt=\"Buenos Aires, Argentina THE CITY OF THE DEAD La Recoleta Cemetery is as impressive as it is morbid, with a tragic legend of a woman who was buried alive and tried to claw her way out of her crypt. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>12. The Abandoned Island</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/058bfffae34f904207f8fe896bdb4824a335658d593ac149b2be78ea43cf87f4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fd92c9290bd4af9b460c9848074ef25fd.jpg\" alt=\"Nagasaki, Japan THE ABANDONED ISLAND Hashima Island, also known as Gunkanjima, used to be a coal mine facility but now lies abandoned like a ghost island, with crumbling buildings and remnants of the forced labor camp that thrived there during WWII. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>11. St. Crispin's</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a7e3db83ddfe71b82f5a098c2f1fbb3941f6c4d99d342db3c6617cd8c13f2b21/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F4321e5a601f9b70b30e3c04ce532a8f1.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. ST CRISPIN'S HOSPITAL NORTHAMPTON, ENGLAND Maciei D. told US about the mental asylum that was built in 1976 and closed in 1995. Before it closed, it was used as a filming location for Doctor Who. Since its closing, there's been mysterious fires. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>10. Atoka School</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/384003e91a5454cbd8a8d1f1aaae4ea679512ef2bc7f1d489f34c4a578e9db39/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fdf7b3f7611ecd009ac8638bf29fa27d5.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. ATOKA SCHOOL ARTESIA, NEW MEXICO James H. tells us, &quot;There have been many reports of people hearing crying children and screams even though it's been abandoned for years.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>9. H.R. Giger's House</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1e7325335226c786cccca6a1af1ef09451616526791f1e37a1a3b91f18c05103/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Ff7b7b58cd40947a705e9c21d0c15da38.jpg\" alt=\"Cribs of the rich and famous H. R. Giger's house Not only is the Alien designer's house a nightmare, it also features its own haunted train ride. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>8. Shanghai Tunnels</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f638aa9fb96f21cb03d6996c8a39016780998335d977eb0f5d0ea85a123808ce/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F08ead420f14b2fa5dfb0c1e969ba552a.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. SHANGHAI TUNNELS PORTLAND, OREGON Ron L. says the secret network of underground tunnels is considered haunted, adding, &quot;People touched. Rocks being thrown. Unexplained sounds. Disembodied voices.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>7. Vermont</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/24897da1fe150aefab2ba4ff8965d9c2ba260ff14f953f13a962994b3552bb7a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h625%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Ff822e9d7c7d76a855fb79399f2d1500d.jpg\" alt=\"MYTH: Roswell, NM is the epicenter of UFO activity in the U.S.. UFO CRASH SITE UFO Museum - 114 N. Main - Roswell FACT: Vermont sees the most UFO sightings per capita at 80.8 sightings per 100,000 residents. CRACKED COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"625\" /></p></figure><h2>6. The Frog</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3a1684eec109d5ba23e9880a658acf977fac283a6c1487001d22f3c275ef1fec/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w800_h840%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F5924b58933b1af6e0a0c2a2c324fc7a4.jpg\" alt=\"The Frog in Toronto, formerly The Frog &amp; Firkin, has been the site of countless purported ghost sightings over the decades. Several dating from around 2002 feature a spectral figure disappearing into the bathrooms, then flushing. CRACKED\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"840\" /></p></figure><h2>5. Broadway</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3458f8dec5bbaa23a00a9a7ee08bfaa62f67251722365e36f18013968bb4a8df/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F53d3d4880564ba6204c2a2264af4bfb6.jpg\" alt=\"ONE BROADWAY THEATER IS A GIANT HAUNTED HOUSE GRACKED Actors are superstitious, but even then, it's hard to ignore decades of regular sightings of ghosts at the Palace Theater, including the ghost of Judy Garland.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"960\" height=\"1182\" /></p></figure><h2>4. Brown Mountain Lights</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4cb850f961997c637072faf6cc6fd3ae9028dc1dce94b9f618494132f0a5ee63/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Ffe1387e6244c86d2f070d6507c2d143a.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. BROWN MOUNTAIN LIGHTS Pisgah National Forest, North Carolina Justin M. explains there's three folklore explanations for mysterious forest lights: &quot;ghosts of Cherokee warriors killed in the forest trying to find their way home by torchlight, ghosts of escaped slaves who died trying to flee to the North, and (of course) ALIENS.&quot; CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>3. Kempton Park</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9c043d97eba03ddd2110da7a4dfd1a309cda5cfa6697d80065a45b10ce09a000/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h750%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2Fc1ef02ecbb670b8c82662866c9350e9c.jpg\" alt=\"Kempton Park, South Africa THE HAUNTED HOSPITAL A hotspot for ghost hunters, the abandoned Kempton Park hospital has been closed since 1996, but a look inside will give you the creeps. Rumors abound of ghost babies crying in the maternity ward and a shadow of a man roaming the hallways. The fact that the hospital was shut down without any word or warning makes the place even creepier. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"750\" /></p></figure><h2>2. Seven Gates of Hell</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/aaa65c1157fa36b8a917a2cbd09a38f4bf4a19b551e1d55730d790be29fb0126/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w600_h675%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F490c9aeaafdd44e911c8f3088841f3e0.jpg\" alt=\"... TELL US NOW. SEVEN GATES OF HELL Collinsville, Illinois 13-11 Eric L. told US about the seven railroad trestles that are the rumored sites of KKK meetings satanic rituals, and paranormal activity. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"600\" height=\"675\" /></p></figure><h2>1. Tantallon Castle</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/477db58190437acb3db029864bda0e6a8f13071b708ac1356ecc01c8fff1ed99/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w550_h700%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcracked_901%2F4cc97c1a537d9b4b706042fe6f7e3c2f.jpg\" alt=\"In 2008 this weird face was found in a picture taken at Tantallon Castle in Scotland. What's weirder is that a family found a similar face looking out the uppermost window in a picture taken 32 years previously. CRACKED.COM\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"550\" height=\"700\" /></p></figure>"
}
